### 일반 담당변경도 stale guard 사용 가능
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/work-assignments/17/trade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toMateId": 4,
  "expectedCurrentMateId": 3,
  "reason": "관리자 담당변경"
}

### 최근 정정 되돌리기
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/work-assignments/17/progress-correction/undo-latest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedLatestProgressId": 31,
  "expectedCurrentLocationId": 87,
  "reason": "최근 정정 되돌리기"
}

### 인수인계 감사로그
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/activity-logs?type=WORK_HANDOVER&page=0&size=50

### 일괄 인수인계 Summary 감사로그
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/activity-logs?type=WORK_BULK_HANDOVER&page=0&size=50
